# DR floor is off). Bucket + IAM + PITR + deletion-protection provisioning and
# the restore drill are documented in
# docs/production-readiness/runbooks/firestore-restore.md.
#
# Provisioned 2026-07-19: gs://zedexams-backups (africa-south1, versioning on,
# uniform access, no public binding); runtime SA has export + storage perms via
# roles/editor + firestore.serviceAgent; DB deletion-protection + 7-day PITR
